  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/516377a5-d390-4a5d-9900-91ca1e7916d0-image.png\" style=\"width: 382px; height: 98px;\" /><br />Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1&#160;</mn></math> &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Put <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>2&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4.2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
